<%= stylesheet_link_tag '/lightek/people-workspace.css' %><main class="lp-workspace"><section class="lp-card"><h1>Set up your authenticator</h1><p>Add a time-based six-digit account to your authenticator. Keep this setup key private.</p><p><strong>Setup key:</strong> <code><%= @secret %></code></p><%= link_to 'Open in authenticator', @uri, class: 'lp-button secondary' %><%= form_with url: confirm_identity_security_path, class: 'lp-form' do |f| %><label>Six-digit code<%= f.text_field :otp, required: true, inputmode: 'numeric', pattern: '[0-9]{6}', autocomplete: 'one-time-code' %></label><%= f.submit 'Verify & enable', class: 'lp-button' %><% end %><p>The setup expires in ten minutes.</p></section></main>
